cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this database, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Thermochemical Energy Storage (TCES) Database"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sathiya Satchi"
    given-names: "Christopher"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6834-5799"
    affiliation: "CIIAE – Iberian Energy Storage Research Center, Cáceres, Spain"
repository-code: "https://github.com/christophersathya-bit/thermochemical-energy-storage-database"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Open, reproducible database of 65 thermochemical energy storage materials and
  reactions, with comparative plots, a classification scheme, a 1D transient
  reactor model, an OpenFOAM packed-bed case and machine-learning models.
  Thermodynamic data come from NIST-JANAF tables and open-access papers; every
  entry carries its source and a verification status.
keywords:
  - thermochemical energy storage
  - thermal energy storage
  - materials database
  - OpenFOAM
  - machine learning
  - dataset
